  "notes": "{保管|ほかん} means keeping something safely stored for future use or preservation. Compound of {保|ほ} (preserve) + {管|かん} (manage). Used as a する verb: {保管|ほかん}する.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {保管|ほかん}{場所|ばしょ}: storage location\n- {保管|ほかん}{庫|こ}: storage room, warehouse\n- {保管|ほかん}{期間|きかん}: storage period\n- {冷蔵|れいぞう}{保管|ほかん}: cold/refrigerated storage\n- {厳重|げんじゅう}に{保管|ほかん}する: to store under strict security\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {保存|ほぞん}: preservation (emphasis on maintaining condition — food, files, historical items)\n- {保管|ほかん}: safekeeping (emphasis on storing securely — documents, valuables)\n- {収納|しゅうのう}: storage, putting away (organizing things neatly in a space)\n\nWATCH OUT:\nSame reading as {補完|ほかん} (supplementation/completion) — different meaning and kanji.",
